\cf2 DefaultItems	Up to eight default items with which to equip this ship when the player buys or captures one. Note that AI-controlled ships will ignore these fields; also, don\'d5t put anything in here that isn\'d5t a physical item - i.e. afterburners, shield boosters, and the like are okay, but no fake IDs, maps, etc.\
	128-255	Ship comes stock with this item\
	-1		Ignored\cf0 \
