Require	logically and'ed with the Contribute fields from the player's current ship and outfit items. If for each 1 bit in the Require fields there is a matching 1 bit in one or more of the Contribute fields, the ship can be purchased. Leave these set to zero if unused. Depending on the configuration of other flags, the ship might appear in the shipyard but not be able to be purchased if the player doesn't meet the Requirements.\
