	Ships' target info picts are stored in PICT resources 3000 and on. The engine is smart enough to reuse targeting picts for two ship classes that have the same base sprites: all you have to do is give the first of any series of\
identical-looking ship types a target pict in the usual way (PICT resource ID\
3000 + shipID - 128) and the engine will use it for all higher-numbered ship\
types with the same base sprites.}